1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,153
Virtual reality is a computer generated three dimensional world that replaces what you see and hear, so you feel present inside it.

2
00:00:09,153 --> 00:00:10,104
It is a loop.

3
00:00:10,104 --> 00:00:20,143
Sensors track your head and hands; the engine draws two images, one per eye, for depth; the headset displays them; you move again.

4
00:00:20,143 --> 00:00:26,861
The loop must close in under about twenty milliseconds, ninety times a second, or the user feels sick.

